            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "For anyone looking, the above solution didn't work or wasn't satisfactory, so I added the following luasnip to my python files:\r\n```lua\r\n    s('f', fmt('print(f{}{}{})', { c(1, { t(\"'\"), t('\"') }), i(2), rep(1) })),\r\n```",
